WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.539
A useful recommendation can remain conditional In the previous

00:00:04.579 --> 00:00:08.711
activity you found that the supplier’s proposed appointment overlaps

00:00:08.724 --> 00:00:11.737
fifteen minutes of preparation and fifteen minutes of the

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:16.053
decision meeting You will now compare possible solutions and

00:00:16.066 --> 00:00:19.895
explain which decision or acceptance each solution still needs

00:00:20.803 --> 00:00:24.592
Daniel must help Lindiwe choose a workable arrangement not

00:00:24.671 --> 00:00:28.500
promise that a proposal has already been approved Each

00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:31.697
panel below explains an option its effect on the

00:00:31.763 --> 00:00:34.763
existing plan and the conditions that must be checked

00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:38.566
You will use this reasoning in the priority decision

00:00:38.618 --> 00:00:40.289
brief in the next activity
